x12 ^ 4 + (1/2) * x12 ^ 3 + -2 * x12 ^ 2 + (-1/2) * x12 + 1 = 0

By inspection x12 = 1 is a solution

After division, polynomial becomes
x12 ^ 3 + (3/2) * x12 ^ 2 + (-1/2) * x12 + -1
By inspection x12 = -1 is a solution

